OL,3,GNEWSA5mph pavement driving limit
OL,4,A'unenforceable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suggested 5mph speed limit for
OL,7,Fdrivers mounting pavements would be
OL,8,Fimpossible to enforce, according to a
OL,9,FGuernsey politician.
OL,11,FEnvironment and Infrastructure
OL,12,FCommittee president Adrian Gabriel was
OL,13,Fresponding to the suggestion by Deputy
OL,14,FRoss Le Brun. The committee has
OL,15,Fpreviously said some of Guernsey's
OL,16,Fnarrow roads leave motorists with
OL,17,Flittle choice but to mount footpaths
OL,18,Fwhen passing oncoming traffic.
OL,20,FGabriel stressed his support for road
OL,21,Fsafety but said a pavement-driving
OL,22,Fspeed limit would be impractical.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
