OL,3,GNEWSA5mph pavement driving limit
OL,4,A'unenforceable'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's probably not a committee view,
OL,7,Fbut I would see imposing a 5mph speed
OL,8,Flimit for driving on pavements as
OL,9,Fsomething which is just unenforceable,"
OL,10,Fhe told BBC Radio Guernsey.
